{
  "name": "Send WhatsApp Appointment Reminders with Poll Confirmation from Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000001",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 860,
        "content": "## WhatsApp Appointment Reminders with Interactive Poll Confirmation (Google Sheets)\n\n### Who this is for\nClinics, salons, consultants, and service businesses tracking bookings in Google Sheets that want automated 24-hour WhatsApp reminders with 1-tap native WhatsApp Poll confirmation — without Meta template approvals.\n\n### How it works (Two-way closed loop)\n- **Flow A — Hourly Reminder Sender:**\n  1. Checks your Google Sheet every hour for upcoming rows where `status` is `Scheduled`, `reminderSent` is not `yes`, and `appointmentIso` falls within the next `reminderWindowHours` (default 24h).\n  2. Sends a personalized reminder + an interactive WhatsApp Poll (`Confirm attendance` / `Need to reschedule`) via **Supergreen**.\n  3. Marks `reminderSent = yes` in the sheet so reminders never send twice.\n- **Flow B — Poll Vote Listener:**\n  1. **When Customer Votes on Poll** (`Supergreen Trigger`, `events: ['vote']`) captures the customer's poll tap in real time.\n  2. Updates the customer's row in Google Sheets to `Confirmed` or `Reschedule Requested` and automatically replies with your booking reschedule link when needed.\n\n### Requirements & Community Node\n- **Community node:** `n8n-nodes-supergreen` (tested on `v0.1.5`, verified community node on **n8n Cloud** & self-hosted — [npm & install guide](https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-supergreen)).\n- **Supergreen API** credential ([supergreen.cc](https://supergreen.cc)) and **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential.\n- A Google Sheet with columns: `phone`, `clientName`, `appointmentIso`, `serviceName`, `reminderSent`, `status`.\n- Tested on n8n `v1.76+`.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Select your spreadsheet in all three **Google Sheets** nodes.\n2. Update `businessName` and `rescheduleUrl` in **Configure Reminder Settings**.\n3. Activate the workflow."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000002",
      "name": "Outbound Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1360,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow A: Hourly Reminder & Interactive Confirmation Poll\n\nReads upcoming bookings from Google Sheets, filters unsent appointments due within the configured window, sends a native WhatsApp Poll, and marks `reminderSent = yes` to prevent duplicate sends."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000003",
      "name": "Inbound Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1360,
        "height": 400,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow B: Real-Time Poll Vote Handler & Reschedule Follow-Up\n\nListens for `vote` events on WhatsApp polls, updates the matching phone number's appointment `status` in Google Sheets, and sends a self-serve reschedule link if the client tapped *Need to reschedule*."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000010",
      "name": "Check Schedule Every Hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        20,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000011",
      "name": "Configure Reminder Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "rem-biz",
              "name": "businessName",
              "value": "Bright Dental Clinic",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "rem-window",
              "name": "reminderWindowHours",
              "value": 24,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "rem-url",
              "name": "rescheduleUrl",
              "value": "https://cal.example.com/reschedule",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000012",
      "name": "Read Appointments Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        460,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "gsheets-cred",
          "name": "Google Sheets Account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Appointments",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000013",
      "name": "Filter Due Unsent Appointments",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const settings = $('Configure Reminder Settings').first().json;\nconst windowMs = Number(settings.reminderWindowHours || 24) * 3600 * 1000;\nconst now = Date.now();\nconst due = [];\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const row = item.json;\n  const cleanPhone = String(row.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  const apptMs = Date.parse(String(row.appointmentIso || ''));\n  const alreadySent = String(row.reminderSent || '').toLowerCase() === 'yes';\n  const status = String(row.status || 'Scheduled').toLowerCase();\n  if (cleanPhone.length >= 8 && !Number.isNaN(apptMs) && !alreadySent && status === 'scheduled') {\n    const diff = apptMs - now;\n    if (diff > 0 && diff <= windowMs) {\n      due.push({\n        json: {\n          cleanPhone,\n          rawPhone: row.phone,\n          clientName: row.clientName || 'there',\n          serviceName: row.serviceName || 'appointment',\n          appointmentIso: row.appointmentIso,\n          businessName: settings.businessName,\n        },\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}\nreturn due;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000014",
      "name": "Send Confirmation Poll on WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-supergreen.supergreen",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        920,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supergreenApi": {
          "id": "supergreen-cred",
          "name": "Supergreen API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "poll",
        "operation": "sendPoll",
        "toNumber": "={{ $json.cleanPhone }}",
        "name": "=Hi {{ $json.clientName }}! Reminder for your {{ $json.serviceName }} at {{ $json.businessName }} ({{ $json.appointmentIso }}). Can you make it?",
        "options": "Confirm attendance, Need to reschedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000015",
      "name": "Mark Reminder Sent in Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1140,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "gsheets-cred",
          "name": "Google Sheets Account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Appointments",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "phone": "={{ $('Filter Due Unsent Appointments').item.json.rawPhone }}",
            "reminderSent": "yes"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "phone"
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000020",
      "name": "When Customer Votes on Poll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-supergreen.supergreenTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        20,
        620
      ],
      "webhookId": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-200000000020",
      "credentials": {
        "supergreenApi": {
          "id": "supergreen-cred",
          "name": "Supergreen API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "network": "whatsapp",
        "events": [
          "vote"
        ],
        "onlyIncoming": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000021",
      "name": "Parse Poll Selection",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const ev = $input.first().json;\nconst selectedIdx = Array.isArray(ev.vote?.selectedOptionIndices) ? ev.vote.selectedOptionIndices[0] : -1;\nconst chatId = String(ev.chat?.id || '');\nconst cleanPhone = chatId.replace(/@.*$/, '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\nif (selectedIdx !== 0 && selectedIdx !== 1) return [];\nconst needsReschedule = selectedIdx === 1;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    chatId,\n    cleanPhone,\n    newStatus: needsReschedule ? 'Reschedule Requested' : 'Confirmed',\n    needsReschedule,\n    rescheduleUrl: 'https://cal.example.com/reschedule',\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000022",
      "name": "Update Attendance Status in Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        500,
        620
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "gsheets-cred",
          "name": "Google Sheets Account"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Appointments",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "phone": "={{ $json.cleanPhone }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.newStatus }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "phone"
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000023",
      "name": "Did Client Request Reschedule?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-resched",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Parse Poll Selection').item.json.needsReschedule }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000024",
      "name": "Send Reschedule Link on WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-supergreen.supergreen",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        560
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supergreenApi": {
          "id": "supergreen-cred",
          "name": "Supergreen API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "toNumber": "={{ $('Parse Poll Selection').item.json.chatId }}",
        "message": "=No problem! You can pick a new time that works best for you here: {{ $('Parse Poll Selection').item.json.rescheduleUrl }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "linkPreview": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3030003-3333-4333-8333-000000000025",
      "name": "Send Confirmation Thank-You",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-supergreen.supergreen",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        720
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supergreenApi": {
          "id": "supergreen-cred",
          "name": "Supergreen API"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "toNumber": "={{ $('Parse Poll Selection').item.json.chatId }}",
        "message": "Thanks for confirming! We look forward to seeing you.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    }
  ],
